<title>POLAND: POLISH SHARES CLOSE MIXED IN CONTINUOUS TRADE.</title>
<headline>POLISH SHARES CLOSE MIXED IN CONTINUOUS TRADE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seven stocks rose, six fell and five were flat in 12.5-million-zloty continuous trade on Thursday with the WIG 20 index closing at 1,786.2 points, 0.8 percent lower than in the regular session.</p>
<p>The remaining four stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units rose 0.6 percent to 166 zlotys in a 25.2-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
